This product is built on the Android Open Source Project and uses gfxstream,
ANGLE, SQLite and Android System WebView (Chromium). Those works are not part of
this repository and keep their own licenses.

A built app contains an Android system image, Android System WebView, gfxstream
and ANGLE. The notices of the graphics libraries are in
ios/Licenses/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, and each release carries them, with the
notices of the Android system image and of WebView (NOTICE-WEBVIEW.html, taken
from the WebView package by tools/extract-webview-credits.py), inside the app
(Licenses/) and beside it.
